AudioWhisper Keyboard: the `latin` crate

This crate is a Rust port of the dictionary reading and typing suggestion code of
LatinIME, the Android Open Source Project's keyboard
(https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/inputmethods/LatinIME, its
native/jni sources). The port keeps LatinIME's structure, names and arithmetic, so
it is a derivative work of that code, which carries this notice:

